      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "FUNCTIONAL REQUIREMENTS\n\n• Ask about campaigns, audiences,\ncontent, journeys\n• Stream grounded answers with\ncitations\n• Generate plans and recommendations\n• Preview action impact\n• Approve / reject / modify actions\n• Execute approved tool calls\n• Cancel, retry, resume runs\n• Preserve conversation history\n• Show tool progress and outcomes",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "FUNCTIONAL REQUIREMENTS\n\n• Ask about campaigns, audiences, content, journeys\n• Stream grounded answers with citations\n• Generate plans and recommendations\n• Preview action impact\n• Approve / reject / modify actions\n• Execute approved tool calls\n• Cancel, retry, resume runs\n• Preserve conversation history\n• Show tool progress and outcomes",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
