      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "NON-FUNCTIONAL REQUIREMENTS\n\n• 99.9% read availability\n• Durable long-running workflows\n• P95 first token < 1.5s\n• Strict tenant isolation\n• Authorization outside the LLM\n• Idempotent write actions\n• Full auditability\n• Versioned prompts, models, tools\n• Cost and token budgets\n• Accessible streaming UX",
