      "updated": 1784144244607,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "TECHNOLOGY CHOICES — WHY\n\nReact + TypeScript — typed event-driven UI\nSSE — simple server→client token/status stream\nPostgreSQL — transactional runs, approvals, audit index\nTemporal — durable retries, timers, approval waits\nKafka — replayable events and independent consumers\nRedis — rate limits, hot cache, dedup only\nOpenSearch — lexical + vector hybrid retrieval\nObject storage — briefs, attachments, large outputs\nOpenTelemetry — end-to-end traces and SLOs",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "TECHNOLOGY CHOICES — WHY\n\nReact + TypeScript — typed event-driven UI\nSSE — simple server→client token/status stream\nPostgreSQL — transactional runs, approvals, audit index\nTemporal — durable retries, timers, approval waits\nKafka — replayable events and independent consumers\nRedis — rate limits, hot cache, dedup only\nOpenSearch — lexical + vector hybrid retrieval\nObject storage — briefs, attachments, large outputs\nOpenTelemetry — end-to-end traces and SLOs",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
