    {
      "id": "b8f0d7305bf5439f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 52,
      "y": 1460,
      "width": 736,
      "height": 350,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "as",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1416349235,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 264594334,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784144233721,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "DEEP DIVE: SECURITY + APPROVAL\n\nLLM proposes; system authorizes and executes.\nPermission filtering happens before retrieval.\nEach tool receives a short-lived scoped credential.\nWrite/destructive actions produce an approval preview.\nApproval includes target, before/after, impact, warnings.\nExecution uses optimistic concurrency and idempotency keys.\nEvery action emits an immutable audit event.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "DEEP DIVE: SECURITY + APPROVAL\n\nLLM proposes; system authorizes and executes.\nPermission filtering happens before retrieval.\nEach tool receives a short-lived scoped credential.\nWrite/destructive actions produce an approval preview.\nApproval includes target, before/after, impact, warnings.\nExecution uses optimistic concurrency and idempotency keys.\nEvery action emits an immutable audit event.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
