      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Technical Rules for SSE protocols:\n-- Specific Headers: The server must reply with 'Content-Type': 'text/event-stream'.\n-- Newline Formatting: Every data block must end with two newlines (\\n\\n) to indicate the end of that specific event payload.\n-- Automatic Reconnection: If the network drops, the browser's EventSource client will automatically\nattempt to reconnect without you writing extra fallback logic.\n-- One-Way Only: Data streams strictly from the server to the client. Clients cannot send data upstream through the same event connection.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Technical Rules for SSE protocols:\n-- Specific Headers: The server must reply with 'Content-Type': 'text/event-stream'.\n-- Newline Formatting: Every data block must end with two newlines (\\n\\n) to indicate the end of that specific event payload.\n-- Automatic Reconnection: If the network drops, the browser's EventSource client will automatically\nattempt to reconnect without you writing extra fallback logic.\n-- One-Way Only: Data streams strictly from the server to the client. Clients cannot send data upstream through the same event connection.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
